    "date_str": "2026-02-11",
    "description": "The Unjust Arrest and Remanding of  Respected Senior Public Servant and Former Presidential Secretary Saman Ekanayake by the JVP led NPP Govt of President Dissanayake.",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=87019",
