    "md5": "604077e0a1160d90dc1522a2c933533f",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1634,
    "chunk_text": "Exterminators PLC launches AI-powered \u2018Report Factory\u2019\n\nExterminators PLC, Sri Lanka\u2019s premier pest management and environmental enhancement technology company, has launched its state-of-the-art AI-powered Report Factory.\n\nThis groundbreaking initiative is set to transform the company\u2019s operations by automating the generation of essential service reports, significantly increasing efficiency and enhancing quality assurance throughout its operations.\n\nAs Asia\u2019s first publicly listed pest control company, Exterminators PLC continues to lead the industry through digital transformation. The new system streamlines the creation of critical documentation, including: Automated Service Reports, Point-based Integrated Pest Management Audit Reports (IPM), Food Safety and Sanitation Audit Reports, Pest Risk Assessment Reports and Detailed Pest Logs by leveraging advanced data analytics, the AI technology assesses specific pest management needs to provide proactive, tailored solutions. This transition not only reduces manual labour and human error but also ensures that clients receive precise, data-driven insights to protect their businesses and brand reputations.\n\nExterminators PLC Managing Director Marlon Ferreira said: \u201cThe AI-powered Report Factory represents a significant leap forward in our operational management. By automating these processes, our team can focus on delivering exceptional service and providing the critical recommendations necessary to mitigate pest risks, especially for the food manufacturing and processing industry, hotels, restaurants, caf\u00e9s, coffee shops, food retail stores, etc.\u201d"
